  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Load DICOM or other medical images, view them with CT windowing kept separate from the raw values, take calibrated distance and angle measurements, compute HU, quality and radiomics metrics, and export de-identified DICOM, DICOM SR, CSV/XLSX and HTML research outputs. Data used in the run: stock. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
